{"step_index":75,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:58:05Z","thinking":"**Defining Frontend Design Principles**\n\nFrontend development begins after backend completion. Design specifications indicate a professional UI suitable for healthcare or security applications. This includes defined primary color palettes to guide visual consistency throughout the frontend.\n\n\n**Defining Application Structure**\n\nThe UI will incorporate specific alert styles for different severity levels, ensuring clear visual communication. A set of design elements will be applied to foster a professional and modern aesthetic. The application will be branded as \"MedCheck BD\", with the tagline \"Verify. Compare. Find. Stay Safe.\"\n\nDefining key pages: Home, Verification, Medicine Details, Price Comparison, Pharmacy Finder, Pharmacy Details, Login, Register, Pharmacy Registration, and Customer Profile will form the core application structure.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   MedCheck BD - Healthcare & Medicine Security Platform Stylesheet\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n  --primary-blue: #0284c7;\n  --primary-dark-blue: #0369a1;\n  --navy-dark: #0f172a;\n  --navy-slate: #1e293b;\n  --navy-light: #334155;\n  --emerald-green: #10b981;\n  --emerald-dark: #059669;\n  --danger-red: #ef4444;\n  --danger-dark: #dc2626;\n  --warning-amber: #f59e0b;\n  --warning-dark: #d97706;\n  --bg-light: #f8fafc;\n  --card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --border-color: #e2e8f0;\n  --text-main: #1e293b;\n  --text-muted: #64748b;\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n  --radius-md: 12px;\n  --radius-lg: 18px;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.07), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);\n  --shadow-xl: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n  background-color: var(--bg-light);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\nmain {\n  flex: 1 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Header & Navbar ----------------- */\n.navbar-custom {\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  color: var(--navy-dark);\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.brand-icon {\n  width: 38px;\n  height: 38px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--emerald-green));\n  color: white;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);\n}\n\n.brand-tagline {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: -3px;\n}\n\n.nav-link-custom {\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--navy-slate) !important;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem !important;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-link-custom:hover, .nav-link-custom.active {\n  color: var(--primary-blue) !important;\n  background-color: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Hero Section ----------------- */\n.hero-section {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #0369a1 100%);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 4.5rem 0;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-section::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-size: 2.8rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.hero-subtitle {\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n  max-width: 620px;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.hero-card-illustration {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 2rem;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Cards & Components ----------------- */\n.card-custom {\n  background-color: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.card-custom:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.feature-box {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 1.8rem;\n  height: 100%;\n  transition: all 0.25s ease;\n}\n\n.feature-box:hover {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n}\n\n.feature-icon-wrapper {\n  width: 54px;\n  height: 54px;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Badges & Status Pills ----------------- */\n.status-pill {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: 50rem;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n}\n\n.status-pill.registered,\n.status-pill.match,\n.status-pill.verified,\n.status-pill.instock,\n.status-pill.approved {\n  background-color: #dcfce7;\n  color: #166534;\n  border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;\n}\n\n.status-pill.review,\n.status-pill.lowstock,\n.status-pill.pending,\n.status-pill.expiring {\n  background-color: #fef3c7;\n  color: #92400e;\n  border: 1px solid #fde68a;\n}\n\n.status-pill.notfound,\n.status-pill.alert,\n.status-pill.expired,\n.status-pill.outofstock,\n.status-pill.rejected,\n.status-pill.recalled {\n  background-color: #fee2e2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Verification Result Card ----------------- */\n.verify-result-card {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.verify-header-match {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #10b981);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;\n}\n\n.verify-header-review {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706, #f59e0b);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;\n}\n\n.verify-header-alert {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626, #ef4444);\n  color: white;\n  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;\n}\n\n.result-detail-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 0.85rem 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n.result-detail-label {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.result-detail-value {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--navy-dark);\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n/* ----------------- Table Styles ----------------- */\n.table-custom {\n  background: white;\n  border-radius: var(--radius